      "id": "docs_superpowers_plans_archive_2026_04_20_launcher_landing_state_launcher",
      "label": "Launcher overlay with mode cards and explore-the-map dismiss",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "rationale": "Session-scoped: a dismiss hides it for the session, a fresh tab re-shows it, deep-link URLs bypass it, and game end re-shows it \u2014 so the default route sells the games without trapping returning explorers.",
      "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/archive/2026-04-20-launcher-landing-state.md",
